    "text": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A collection of marsupials from the family Vombatidae and close relatives, these mammals will occupy the warmer temperate, sub tropical and tropical regions of your world. The koala will be joining them at a later date!</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This mod includes:</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-toggle\">Stats</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler-text\">\n<table dir=\"ltr\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-baot=\"1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\"><colgroup><col width=\"199\" /><col width=\"166\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"136\" /><col width=\"111\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /><col width=\"100\" /></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 256.991px;\">Common Name</td>\n<td style=\"width: 165.995px;\">Scientific name</td>\n<td style=\"width: 154.988px;\">Category</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Weight</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Health</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Height</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Damage</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Temp</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Precip</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Foliage Needs</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Altitude</td>\n<td style=\"width: 135.995px;\">Group Size</td>\n<td style=\"width: 110.995px;\">Meat Drops</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Fat Drops</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Hide Drops</td>\n<td style=\"width: 350.995px;\">Diets</td>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9884px;\">Behaviors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 256.991px;\">M